.source_subhead
    h1 Plug and play modules
    p Plug and play components are standalone components that can be used on any project, without having any sort of dependencies.they are an extract of certain UX3 organisms to be imported to some non UX3 projects, these module should only include the styles needed to make it look as intended, styles should be self contained and do not include generic styles so it wouldn't break sites that it would be applied to.
    | In non ux3 projects. imported plug and play modules should be treated the same as plugins so they would be placed at the top of the css structure, this would also help making it easier to override their css so it would be done without going crazy with specificity.
